# Cloudflare Pages headers for The Aurelia Palace (static site, no backend).
# Clears the PageSpeed "Trust and Safety" items (HSTS, frame control, CSP).
# CSP is scoped to what this site actually uses: same-origin scripts/styles,
# self-hosted fonts, Unsplash images only. style-src needs 'unsafe-inline'
# because Tailwind's CSS is inlined into <style> (inlineStyleThreshold).
# script-src ALSO needs 'unsafe-inline': SvelteKit's hydration bootstrap
# (__sveltekit_<hash> = { base, version }) is an inline <script> the
# framework emits on every prerendered page, and the motion gate in the
# layout head is an inline script that must run before paint. A nonce
# would need a server to inject it per request, which a static Pages site
# does not have — so 'unsafe-inline' is the honest choice here, and the
# CSP still blocks objects, frames, off-origin images/fonts/fetches.
# No Trusted Types directive on purpose: SvelteKit injects the JSON-LD
# structured data via {@html}, which requires innerHTML.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' https://images.unsplash.com data:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
